# flatpak-builder's cache: a copy of the source tree plus every crate
# it downloaded. Ignored so it is neither committed nor walked —
# treefmt reformatted 9,310 vendored files inside it once, which took
# five minutes and failed the gate.
/.flatpak-builder/
